<odoo>
    <template
        id="report_invoice_document_tax_exemption"
        inherit_id="account.report_invoice_document"
    >
        <xpath expr="//p[@name='note']" position="after">
            <p
                t-if="o.l10n_tn_tax_exemption_id"
                name="l10n_tn_tax_exemption"
                style="font-size: 11px; font-family: 'Courier New', monospace; color: #555555;"
            >
                <span
                class="font-weight-bold text-uppercase"
                style="text-decoration: underline;"
            >Mentions Légales Obligatoires (Régime Suspensif)</span>
                <br />
                • Vente en suspension de la TVA (Attestation N°: <span
                t-field="o.l10n_tn_tax_exemption_id.name"
            /> du <span t-field="o.l10n_tn_tax_exemption_id.date_start" />)
                <br />
                • Bon de Commande Visé N°: <span
                t-field="o.l10n_tn_bon_de_commande_vise"
            /> du <span t-field="o.l10n_tn_bon_de_commande_vise_date" />
            </p>
        </xpath>
    </template>
</odoo>
